 "remarks": "Two properties offer exceptional opportunity for builders, developers or investors. (See list.# 24216746) It consists of two multi-family homes on approximately 11,000 sq. ft. of land in Stamford's rapidly growing South End. 76-78 Garden St. Assessor's card as a 4-family home. 72-74 Garden St. Assessor's card as a 3-family home. These parcels originally zoned R-MF to recently rezoned and approved to Stamford's V-C2 zoning district, which allows for increased density and expanded redevelopment potential. Please DO NOT DISTURB THE TENANTS. LAND VALUE- Properties are being sold strictly in as-is condition. Buyers and Buyer's agents responsible for their own due diligence. Incredible location with super conveniences. Near Metro-North, Downtown, Restaurants and I-95. Agents to provide pre-approval, proof of funds when submitting offers.",
